  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 500
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 无惑真人如蒙大赦，领着冲虚散人迅速离去了，场中只留下了你，林家众人和星宫宫主、星铃儿师徒。
