  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 344
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你也适时拿出一坛极品盈手露放在桌上，灵力稍一激发，将泥封震裂，散落的碎渣也是被灵力尽皆荡开。
